                <li>Be MORE selective with quotes (use only the BEST evidence)</li>
                <li>Focus on 2-3 major parallels and 2-3 major differences (not exhaustive)</li>
                <li>Write more concisely - less analysis per text, more synthesis across texts</li>
                <li>Manage time carefully: ~2 hours outlining, 6 hours writing, 2 hours revising</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legend">
