                </tr>
            </table>
            <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><strong>Key difference:</strong> TGM has <span class="critical">MOST elaborate symbolic system</span> - nearly every object = symbol. Williams's stage directions explicitly state symbolic meanings. Glass menagerie = most famous theatrical symbol in American drama (represents Laura, fragility of dreams, memory itself, beauty that can't survive reality).</p>
